{"version":1,"content":"<p>憑藉經典宮鬥劇《步步驚心》中「明玉格格」一角走紅的38歲內地女星劉玥霏（原名劉雨欣），近年轉戰荷里活發展並旅居美國洛杉磯。</p><p>然而，她日前（21日）在社交網崩潰自爆，自己的美國住處在短短兩年內竟二度遭竊賊闖入洗劫，讓她氣得在網上爆粗，痛批當地治</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T05:24:03.717596+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T04:56:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T05:17:20.656250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T05:17:20.656250+00:00","content_hash":"a756b6e124778aabd1299089e7ea0d8cb38a3e822b72750688b56d0fe673f0a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}